      "content": "yeah i get that. but like, if she seems fine on the outside but something is just... wrong in there, is there any way to distinguish between a normal post-op recovery and something more malicious like a bad bacterial infection? i just don't want to be caught off guard by something hidden that's eating away at her from the inside.",
